## Shared snippet documents.vm (shared/vm), inlined by tools/build-widget.py at "## BW_SHARED documents.vm".
## Collects the documents into docList / docByKey (maps with key, project, id, title, space, type, status, created,
## updated, rev, items, itemObjs, module). Needs common.vm.
## HEAD (no colRef): the documents of the projects in scope. Optional: docOnly = list of keys (project/space/name) to
## keep among the documents of the current project; docOther = the same for the documents of the other projects in
## scope. Empty or unset = all documents.
## Collection (colRef = collection reference, set by the widget): the documents of the collection and of its upstream
## collections, each at the revision the collection pins (rev = that revision, "HEAD" when none is pinned), with their
## work items at that revision. Verified on 2512 (docCoverage spike K2, K3, extra round).
